### Upload Form Image: is the AI service available?
GET {{NewDynamicFormGenAPI_HostAddress}}/api/form-image/status
Accept: application/json

### Upload Form Image: ask the AI for the type of each label (can take 1-2 minutes)
POST {{NewDynamicFormGenAPI_HostAddress}}/api/form-image/classify-labels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "labels": ["Employee Name", "Leave Type", "From Date", "Number of Days", "Upload Photo", "Personal Details"]
}

